# SHA-256 of the plugin artifact for botan 3.2.0.
#
# This file mirrors the sha256 field in manifest.toml. It is kept as a
# standalone file so that install tooling and mirrors can fetch just the
# hash without downloading the manifest, and so that `sha256sum -c` style
# verification has a canonical input.
#
# Format: <hex digest>  <basename of artifact>
